# Model constraints

- Use **only Claude** through the Anthropic API (`@anthropic-ai/sdk` / `anthropic`, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`). Do not add Grok, OpenAI, Gemini, or other LLM providers.
- Default model is `claude-opus-5-5` (`CLAUDE_MODEL`). Do not send `temperature`, `budget_tokens` or a forced `tool_choice`; they are rejected.
- The live bot is `messaging/` (Tobi). `bot/` is an unused Python scaffold. Otis owns the app (`src/`), whose research agents live in `src/server/claude/` and `src/server/agents/`. Arden owns `website/`.
- The Bot API contract is `src/server/bot/tools.ts` → `docs/bot-tools.json`. Add fields, never rename.
- No Campus Shape references. Keep student-voice drafts, not recruiter voice.
